WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:01.000
Concept animation: a robot identifies tennis balls on a court.

00:01.000 --> 00:04.200
The robot approaches the first ball and collects it.

00:04.200 --> 00:07.400
It travels toward the second ball; its camera view is shown as a cone.

00:07.400 --> 00:10.600
The robot approaches and collects the third ball.

00:10.600 --> 00:12.000
Find, approach, collect: the conceptual loop repeats. Not prototype footage.
